    <body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0487.gamos.meineke1841-grc1" xml:lang="grc">
      <div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0487.gamos.meineke1841-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0487_gamos">
        <head>ΓΑΜΟΣ</head>
        <pb n="8" facs="urn:hathi:hvd.32044098646714:scan:32" />
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" author_heading="Philemo" work_heading="ΓΑΜΟΣ" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0487-gamos-1">
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0487-gamos-1-l1">Ὁλκεῖον εἶδον ἐν τραπέζῃ κείμενον</l>
            <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0487-gamos-1-l2">πυρῶν τι μεστόν.</l>
          </lg>
          <note type="source">Pollux X 176: ὁλκεῖον, ἀγγεῖον ὑγρῶν τε καὶ ξηρῶν — ἐν Φιλήμονος Γάμῳ Ὁλκεῖον εἶδον κτλ.</note>
          <note type="apparatus">Vs. 1 vulgo ὅλκιον. Codd. ὁλκεῖον. — Vs. 2 τι pro τε scripsi ex codd.</note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" author_heading="Philemo" work_heading="ΓΑΜΟΣ" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0487-gamos-2">
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0487-gamos-2-l1">Ἐν Καρὶ τὸν κίνδυνον οἶσθα, δέσποτα.</l>
          </lg>
          <note type="source">Scholiasta Platonis ed. Bekk. p. 322. ἐν τῷ Καρὶ ὑμῶν ὁ κίνδυνος: — μέμνηται ταύτης καὶ Φιλήμων ἐν Γάμῳ Ἐν Καρί κτλ.</note>
          <note type="apparatus">Vulgo οἶδα. Correxit Buttmannus.</note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="3" author_heading="Philemo" work_heading="ΓΑΜΟΣ" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0487-gamos-3">
          <note type="source">Antiatticista p. 92 16: Ἐμὲ ἀντὶ τοῦ ἐμαυτόν, σὲ ἀντὶ τοῦ σαυτόν. Φιλήμων Γαμοῦντι <quote>
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0487-gamos-3-l1">Σῶζε σαυτόν, ἐγὼ δ᾽ ἐμέ.</l>
              </lg>
            </quote>
          </note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="4" author_heading="Philemo" work_heading="ΓΑΜΟΣ" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0487-gamos-4">
          <note type="source">Antiatticista p. 99 24: Θρασέα. Φιλήμων Γάμῳ <quote>
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0487-gamos-4-l1">θρασέα γυνή.</l>
              </lg>
            </quote>
          </note>
          <note type="apparatus">Ita correxi editum Γάλλῳ.</note>
        </div>
      </div>
